  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nStep 10 of the [inner navigate event firing algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#inner-navigate-event-firing-algorithm) currently says to check for transient activation. However, step 29.1 consumes the history-action user activation, I would expect Step 10 to check for this activation *not* transient activation.",
